  "paragraphs": [
    [
      "P001",
      "INSPECTION AND SERVICE PLAN",
      false,
      "heading",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P002",
      "To make sure that the stand-by pumps are ready for operation, start them up once a week.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P003",
      "• Monitor the bearing temperature.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P004",
      "The bearing temperature must not exceed 85 °C (measured at the motor housing).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P005",
      "Inspect the shaft seal for leaks at regular intervals.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P006",
      "- Before inspection of a pump without guard, check that the pump cannot be started\nunintentionally.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P007",
      "- The system is to be without pressure and drained of liquid.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P008",
      "- The repairman must be familiar with the type of liquid which has been pumped as well as the\nsafety measures is to be taken when handling the liquid.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P009",
      "CAUTION",
      false,
      "heading",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P010",
      "RISK OF PROPERTY DAMAGE!",
      false,
      "heading",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P011",
      "Operation of the pump at incorrect bearing temperature could damage the pump.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002",
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P012",
      "Make sure that the bearing temperature of the pump (set) is not more than 90 C\n(measured on the outside of the motor housing).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002",
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P013",
      "NOTE: After commissioning, increased temperatures may occur at grease-lubricated rolling\nelement bearing due to the running-in process.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002",
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P014",
      "The final bearing temperature is only reached\nafter a certain period of operation (up to 48 hours depending on the conditions).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002",
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P015",
      "On pumps with bearing (/-02 design or Spacer), the drain hole at the mechanical shaft seal must\nbe inspected regularly (see drawing example below).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002",
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P016",
      "Clean the drain hole as needed.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002",
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P017",
      "If the drain\nhole clogs up, leaking liquid and/or vapor from the shaft seal can be forced up into the bearing\nunit, which can result in a much shorter bearing life than normal.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "68:column:0",
      null,
      [
