    [
      "P023",
      "Inspection and maintenance intervals for normal applications:\n(Half intervals are recommended for a new application – until required intervals can be determined for the actual\napplication)\n(If daily inspection is not done remote monitoring of pump is recommended – e.g. via temperature sensors on pump\nbearings)\nInspect (I) or Maintain (M) at the",
      true,
      "prose",
      "69:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S004"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P024",
